WEBVTT

00:08:29.799 --> 00:08:32.957
kingereza tosha na muunganisho wa intaneti

00:08:32.957 --> 00:08:34.402
anaweza kusoma na sisi.

00:08:34.402 --> 00:08:37.168
Hatutumii redio. Hatutumii video.

00:08:37.168 --> 00:08:39.816
upana wa bendi si hoja.

00:08:39.816 --> 00:08:42.210
Mwanafunzi yeyote kutoka kokote duniani

00:08:42.210 --> 00:08:44.222
aliye na mwuunganisho wowote wa intaneti

00:08:44.222 --> 00:08:46.606
anaweza kusoma nasi.

00:08:46.606 --> 00:08:48.797
tuko malezi-huru.

00:08:48.797 --> 00:08:51.140
tuulizacho tu wanafunzi wetu kukidhi

00:08:51.140 --> 00:08:52.884
ni gharama ya mitihani yao,

00:08:52.884 --> 00:08:55.396
Dola 100 kwa kila mtihani.

00:08:55.396 --> 00:08:58.070
Mwanafunzi wa muda kamili 
wa digrii ya hahada ya kwanza

00:08:58.070 --> 00:09:00.020
anayechukua kozi 40,